# VoiseUp Project Core

Greenfield IMVERA voice + telephony. **No legacy voice codebase.**

Before coding: read `AGENTS.md` and `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`.

## Non-negotiables

- ONE owner per layer: Planner / State / Renderer / Validator / Realtime / Transport
- Transport (SIP/RTP) never generates Vera speech
- Voiseup emits events; Core owns verdicts (GREEN/YELLOW/RED)
- `canonical_assistant_text == phone_spoken_text`
- Report CHANGED / VERIFIED / NOT VERIFIED / REMAINING RISKS / NEXT GATE — never bare «готово»
- Runtime truth before production bug fixes (SHA, engine, endpoints, flags)

## Forbidden

- Dual FSM or dual dialogue brain
- Hidden/silent fallbacks
- tests green == production ready
- TECHNICAL/NO_CONTACT → GREEN
- Stubs (`pass`, fake `ok`, TODO) in production paths
- Fourth system / architecture rewrite (ADR-014)
- New features, scenarios, voice design, or models until 100 consecutive full calls (ADR-014)

## Skills

Use `.agents/skills/` for workflows. Match skill to task per `AGENTS.md` skills map.
